; claude: tinybox's menu in a browser, Tinybox_web (plan_tinybox_web.md):
; the menu and its data, no program, no sources; a program chosen is
; its own page. make website builds it with --profile=release-js and
; puts it in the assets beside the programs, its page docs/tinybox.html.
